+ all_sequences.py:
Its core is the test_all_sequences() function, which
takes in a list of rewrite rules and a query
and enumerates all the rewrite orders.

Usage:
+ Before running:
    + Modify the OpenAI client in explore_rule_pair.py to use
      your LLM.
    + Modify DB_CONFIG in explore_rule_pair.py to connect to
      your database instance. This is used to retrieve
      the schema info of the database to assist the LLM.
+ run python3 gen_order_sensitive_queries.py
+ To test another set of rules, modify gen_order_sensitive
  _queries.py's generate() function, see code for more details.

